<title>UK: L-Bank sets 10 billion peseta 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 10 billion peseta 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN ESP   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    06.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.53     PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
